      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PANADERO DIVA (1) has an excellent record over this course and distance having never missed the placings in five starts, including two wins and three placings. In the money last time at this track (22.75) in a Grade 5, finishing a 3.5 lengths third. Looks a leading chance on best. COOL RUNNINGS (3) trailed the lead and fought on well to be beaten 3 lengths into second (22.84) at this track in a Grade 5 over 400m. Bold showing expected. BLUE AND BOUJEE (2) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing fifth (22.69) in a Grade 5 at this track. Form at the trip sound including three wins. Great chance to atone. DODGY DANNY (4) must be respected despite an unplaced effort here most recently.",
